  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender and Energy &#x2013; Gender mainstreaming in energy cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender programme package with includes training, action design, establishment of a pilot procjec in Cabo Delgado and a project which focuses on energy for cocking. 
Involving four ministries with MOE as lead implementing agency
.


Programme is based on review and mapping of possibilities to mainstream gender in the Norwegian Energy and OfU support in Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
